<style>
  .svarakshit-htu {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background: {{ section.settings.bg_color }};
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    color: #111;
  }

  .htu-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .htu-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .htu-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #111;
  }

  .htu-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .htu-timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 120px;
  }

  .htu-line {
    position: absolute;
    display: block !important;
    left: 59px;
    top: 40px;
    bottom: 40px;
    width: 4px;
    background: #e4e4e4;
    z-index: 1;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .htu-line-fill {
    position: absolute;
    display: block !important;
    left: 59px;
    top: 40px;
    width: 4px;
    background: #E87722;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 0px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: height 0.1s ease-out;
  }

  .htu-step {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .htu-step:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .htu-step-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    left: -120px;
    width: 120px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 3;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .htu-step-dot {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #e4e4e4;
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
  }

  .htu-step-num {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #111;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .htu-step-lbl {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #666;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    transition: color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .htu-step.is-active .htu-step-dot {
    border-color: #E87722;
    background: #E87722;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(232, 119, 34, 0.15);
  }
  .htu-step.is-active .htu-step-num,
  .htu-step.is-active .htu-step-lbl {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .htu-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3rem;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }

  .htu-step.is-active .htu-card {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .htu-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .htu-card-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 16px;
    color: #E87722;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .htu-card-icon svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
  }

  .htu-card-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .htu-card-desc {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .htu-card-desc ul {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    list-style-type: disc;
  }

  .htu-card-desc li {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .htu-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .svarakshit-htu {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }
    .htu-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .htu-timeline {
      padding-left: 48px;
    }
    .htu-line, .htu-line-fill {
      left: 22px;
    }
    .htu-step-indicator {
      left: -48px;
      width: 48px;
    }
    .htu-step-dot {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-width: 2px;
    }
    .htu-step-num {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .htu-step-lbl {
      display: none;
    }
    .htu-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }
    .htu-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    .htu-card-header {
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .htu-card-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .htu-card-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
    }
    .htu-card-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .htu-card-desc {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .htu-pill {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .htu-pill svg {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="svarakshit-htu">
  <div class="htu-container">
    <div class="htu-header">
      <h2 class="htu-title">{{ section.settings.title | default: 'How to Use Swarakshit' }}</h2>
      <p class="htu-subtitle">{{ section.settings.subtitle | default: 'Follow these 5 simple steps to detect gas leaks accurately and keep your home safe' }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="htu-timeline" id="htuTimeline">
      <div class="htu-line"></div>
      <div class="htu-line-fill" id="htuLineFill"></div>

      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'step' -%}
          {%- assign step_num = forloop.index -%}
          {%- if step_num < 10 -%}
            {%- assign step_label = '0' | append: step_num -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign step_label = step_num | append: '' -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="htu-step" data-step="{{ step_num }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="htu-step-indicator">
              <div class="htu-step-dot">
                <span class="htu-step-num">{{ step_label }}</span>
                <span class="htu-step-lbl">Step</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="htu-card">
              <div class="htu-card-header">
                <div class="htu-card-icon">
                  {{ block.settings.icon_svg }}
                </div>
                <h3 class="htu-card-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="htu-card-desc">
                {{ block.settings.description }}
              </div>
              {%- if block.settings.pill_text != blank -%}
                <div class="htu-pill">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0;" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.25 11.25l.041-.02a.75.75 0 011.063.852l-.708 2.836a.75.75 0 001.063.853l.041-.021M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9-3.75h.008v.008H12V8.25z" />
                  </svg>
                  {{ block.settings.pill_text }}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const timeline = document.getElementById('htuTimeline');
    const fill = document.getElementById('htuLineFill');
    const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.htu-step');
    
    if (!timeline || !fill || steps.length === 0) return;

    const onScroll = () => {
      const windowHeight = window.innerHeight;
      const triggerY = windowHeight * 0.6;
      
      const firstStep = steps[0].getBoundingClientRect();
      const lastStep = steps[steps.length - 1].getBoundingClientRect();
      
      const startTrigger = firstStep.top + 40; 
      const endTrigger = lastStep.top + 40;
      
      const totalDistance = endTrigger - startTrigger;
      const scrolledPastStart = triggerY - startTrigger;
      
      const grayLine = document.querySelector('.htu-line');
      if (grayLine && totalDistance > 0) {
        grayLine.style.height = `${totalDistance}px`;
        grayLine.style.bottom = 'auto';
      }
      
      let fillPixels = 0;
      if (scrolledPastStart > 0) {
        fillPixels = Math.min(scrolledPastStart, totalDistance);
      }
      
      fill.style.height = `${fillPixels}px`;
      
      steps.forEach(step => {
        const stepRect = step.getBoundingClientRect();
        const stepCenter = stepRect.top + 40; 
        
        if (stepCenter <= triggerY) {
          step.classList.add('is-active');
        } else {
          step.classList.remove('is-active');
        }
      });
    };

    window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
    setTimeout(onScroll, 100);
  });
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Swarakshit How To Use",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Section Title",
      "default": "How to Use Swarakshit"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Section Subtitle",
      "default": "Follow these 5 simple steps to detect gas leaks accurately and keep your home safe"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#f9f9f9"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Step",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Step Title",
          "default": "Charge & Power On"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "id": "icon_svg",
          "label": "Step Icon (paste SVG code)",
          "default": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 10.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v2.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125H21M4.5 10.5h6.75V15H4.5v-4.5zM3.75 18h15A2.25 2.25 0 0021 15.75v-6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25h-15A2.25 2.25 0 001.5 9.75v6A2.25 2.25 0 003.75 18z' /></svg>"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "description",
          "label": "Step Description",
          "default": "<p>Insert 2 AAA batteries into the battery compartment at the base of the device. Press and hold the red power button for 2 seconds to switch on. The LCD display will light up and show a startup sequence.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pill_text",
          "label": "Tip / Pill Text (leave blank to hide)",
          "default": "Tip: Charge once a week for regular household use"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Swarakshit How To Use",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Charge & Power On",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 10.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v2.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125H21M4.5 10.5h6.75V15H4.5v-4.5zM3.75 18h15A2.25 2.25 0 0021 15.75v-6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25h-15A2.25 2.25 0 001.5 9.75v6A2.25 2.25 0 003.75 18z' /></svg>",
            "description": "<p>Insert 2 AAA batteries into the battery compartment at the base of the device. Press and hold the red power button for 2 seconds to switch on. The LCD display will light up and show a startup sequence.</p>",
            "pill_text": "Tip: Charge once a week for regular household use"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wait for Sensor Warmup (30 Seconds)",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z' /></svg>",
            "description": "<p>After powering on, wait 30 seconds for the electrochemical sensor to reach operating temperature. The display will show dashes or a countdown. Do NOT start testing until the warmup is complete — early readings may be inaccurate. The device will beep once when ready.</p>",
            "pill_text": "Important: Do not skip the warmup phase"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scan Near Gas Points",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z' /></svg>",
            "description": "<p>Hold the device by the grip and move the silver metal sensor tip to within <strong>5–10 cm</strong> of potential leak points. Move slowly — about 5 cm per second — to give the sensor time to respond. Check these key areas in order:</p><ul><li>LPG cylinder valve &amp; pressure regulator</li><li>Rubber pipe connections at both ends</li><li>Gas burner nozzles and knobs</li><li>Gas geyser pipe connections</li><li>PNG meter and pipe joints</li></ul>",
            "pill_text": "Keep sensor tip 5–10 cm from surface for best accuracy"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Read the LCD Display",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 12V5.25' /></svg>",
            "description": "<p>The LCD continuously shows the ambient gas concentration level and temperature. Watch for changes as you move the sensor:</p><ul><li><strong>Normal reading</strong> — Low numbers, no alarm. Area is safe.</li><li><strong>Rising numbers</strong> — Approaching a gas source. Slow down and probe carefully.</li><li><strong>\"Hi\" on display + loud beep</strong> — Gas leak detected at this point!</li></ul>",
            "pill_text": "The display also shows temperature — useful for kitchen safety checks"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "If Leak Detected — Act Immediately",
            "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 24 24' stroke-width='1.5' stroke='currentColor'><path stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z' /></svg>",
            "description": "<p>If the device shows <strong>\"Hi\"</strong> and alarms:</p><ul><li><strong>DON'T panic</strong> — stay calm</li><li><strong>Turn OFF</strong> the gas cylinder valve or main PNG valve immediately</li><li><strong>Open ALL windows &amp; doors</strong> — ventilate the area</li><li><strong>Do NOT use</strong> electrical switches, lighters, phones near the area</li><li><strong>Evacuate</strong> everyone from the room</li><li><strong>Call your gas agency</strong> and a licensed plumber for inspection</li></ul>",
